 ## Introduction
 
-Dart Code extends [VS Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/) with support for the
-[Dart](https://dart.dev/) programming language, and provides tools for
-effectively editing, refactoring, running, and reloading [Flutter](https://flutter.dev/)
-mobile apps.
+<p align="start">
+  <img src="media/dartnative.png" alt="DartNative" width="128" />
+</p>
 
+DartNative extends [DartCode](https://dartcode.org/) extension and provides tools for
+effectively editing, refactoring, running, and reloading [DartNative](https://dartnative.com/)
+mobile apps.
 
